{"user":"Where are my GTK4.0 theme files?"}
{"Bash":"find /home/krubics/.config/gtk-4.0 /home/krubics/.local/share/themes /usr/share/themes -maxdepth 3 -name "gtk.css" -o -name "*.css" 2>/dev/null | head -40; echo "---"; ls /home/krubics/.config/gtk-4.0 2>/dev/null || echo "(no ~/.config/gtk-4.0)"; echo "---"; ls /home/krubics/.local/share/themes 2>/dev/null || echo "(no ~/.local/share/themes)"; echo "---"; ls /usr/share/themes 2>/dev/null | head -20"}
{"Bash":"find /home/krubics/.config/gtk-4.0 /home/krubics/.local/share/themes /usr/share/themes -maxdepth 3 -name "gtk.css" -o -name "*.css" 2>/dev/null | head -40; echo "---"; ls /home/krubics/.config/gtk-4.0 2>/dev/null || echo "(no ~/.config/gtk-4.0)"; echo "---"; ls /home/krubics/.local/share/themes 2>/dev/null || echo "(no ~/.local/share/themes)"; echo "---"; ls /usr/share/themes 2>/dev/null | head -20"}
{"user":"So I should change the gtk-4.0 css file to make changes right?"}
{"user":"What colors names does gtk4-widget-factory use?"}
{"user":"What css file does the gtk.css override?"}
{"user":"How did you get this priority ladder?"}
{"user":"How do you know my GTK-4 active theme?"}
{"user":"I want to adw-gtk3 as a theme but it doesn't have a gtk4 folder within the theme"}
{"Edit":{"file_path":"/home/krubics/.config/gtk-4.0/settings.ini","adds":"[Settings]
gtk-theme-name=adw-gtk3-dark","removes":"[Settings]","removesTruncated":false}}
